# hangedman_zot_decor_tridents keeps its authored Zot geometry and source selectors.
# Named Lua hooks below perform only the source decisions that
# cannot remain static DES directives.
# Source: crawl-ref/source/dat/des/branches/zot.des.
NAME:    hangedman_zot_decor_tridents
TAGS:    transparent extra
DEPTH:   Zot
KFEAT:   Z = zot trap
SHUFFLE: vb / xy / XY
SUBST:   = = ()+Z .:60, - : ++., _ : +.., H : z., I : z., J : z.
SUBST:   K : zzwl...., L : zzzwl.., M : zzwl...
SUBST:   N : zzzwl.., O : zzwl..., P : zzwl.., XyYz = x
KMASK:   wl = no_monster_gen
MAP
         xxx.....
         xxx.......
         x...Iv.vv.
    .....x...v.....
  .....K.-.O...N..@
.........x...v.....
.bb.bJ..Pxv_vHv.vv.
.....b...x...v.....
@..L...M.=.M...L..@
.....b...y...v.....
.bb.bHb_byP..Jv.vv.
.....b...y.........
@..N...O.-.K.....
.....b...y.....
.bb.bI...y
.......yyy
  .....yyy
ENDMAP
